# Story page: nm-sunflower
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Wilted
---
The sunflowers bowed their heads, and kept bowing, until they touched the ground.

Every apple browned before {name} could reach it. Gold went to rust; sweetness went to vinegar.

'Everything good spoils if you wait,' said the coil. 'So stop waiting.' I am not sure that is advice. I am sure it is a threat.
